01:18:58.140 --> 01:19:01.960
God created the woman

01:19:01.960 --> 01:19:03.000
three different times.

01:19:03.000 --> 01:19:05.600
once in Perek Alov and twice in Perek Beg.

01:19:06.020 --> 01:19:07.700
The first time in Perek Beg before he described

01:19:07.700 --> 01:19:09.020
the tree and the second time afterwards.

01:19:09.540 --> 01:19:11.600
And it was in the first Perek when he talked about Pirog Rehob.

01:19:12.000 --> 01:19:14.020
Yes. You see, what happened is very simple.

01:19:14.220 --> 01:19:15.080
In the first chapter,

01:19:16.000 --> 01:19:17.700
what is the first chapter of this

01:19:17.700 --> 01:19:19.660
where? The creation

01:19:19.660 --> 01:19:20.260
of the universe.

01:19:21.720 --> 01:19:23.680
And Adam is

01:19:23.680 --> 01:19:25.600
referred to as an item, another

01:19:25.600 --> 01:19:27.220
item in the

01:19:27.220 --> 01:19:28.760
universe.

01:19:29.440 --> 01:19:31.520
So it refers to him, you know, just like

01:19:31.520 --> 01:19:33.840
He speaks to the animal, about the animals, about the trees,

01:19:33.920 --> 01:19:35.020
he speaks about Adam.

01:19:35.700 --> 01:19:38.180
In general terms. Then he goes into the second chapter

01:19:38.180 --> 01:19:40.160
and develops that idea.

